msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If you do not put them into words, your feelings will never make it through to anyone."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫想いは口にしないと、⟪k:2⟫伝わらないものですよ……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2DB55ED7_BC6A_4C0E_8B54_8EF9ED930FDA
