#: scenario3:scenario3_6CEB79CF_4400_4325_9C8E_F68A55F1FC7C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62fb0e6fc6f8a798f7d3f1c686cf7676f0c53284d0ef0922d85f7c205d505afa
