msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And at some point, he found himself in a position where he was no longer able to speak his "
"mind."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫いつの間にか、⟪k:1⟫言いたいことも言えないような状況に、⟪k:2⟫なっていたのかもしれませんね。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E2C62720_EB95_4F1A_815E_0940A0F0BF4F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b6988b20e52e2108f2957bf4d0bc248a3257c8c2d20c5754cc8c717863b65769
