msgid "⟪k:0⟫Or perhaps someone like him simply would not,⟪k:1⟫even if they knew how."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あるいは、⟪k:1⟫彼のような人は――分かっていても、⟪k:2⟫言わなかったのかもしれません。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_8827CF43_922A_4FB4_BA34_A1243995CC33
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f441c1dc6333961c6ea6e0ef325acff591d453d2382f5f76c237e53004df3fac
